# Nine Under

- C++20 / Vulkan 1.3 custom engine. Windows-first.
- `engine/` must never `#include` anything from `game/`.
- Public headers use the `nu/` prefix (`#include "nu/core/log.hpp"`).
- Lore stays in `LORE.md`; mechanical changes go in `CHANGELOG.md`.
- Prefer fixed 60 Hz simulation with interpolated render.
- Keep Vulkan validation clean in `debug` / `dev` presets.
